{"id":"proteccio_n","lemma":"protección","pos":"noun","rank":1314,"glosses":["protection"],"ipa":"/pɾoteɡˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"protecciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-protecci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"No necesito tu protección.","en":"I don't need your protection.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594665"},{"text":"Hay muy buenas protecciones contra la tentación, pero la más segura es la cobardía.","en":"There are several good protections against temptation, but the surest is cowardice."},{"text":"Este bosque necesita nuestra protección.","en":"This forest needs our protection.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/688479"},{"text":"Querían protección.","en":"They wanted protection.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64989"},{"text":"No necesito protección.","en":"I don't need protection.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460271"}]}